'''Lucky''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading. 
==Appearance==
Lucky’s blade is dark green in color with a lucky four-leaf clover imprinted in the center, hence the name. The guard is dark copper, and the handle is solid black.

